  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonar Music SA - YLE 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Leader Exchange is part of the Partner Project, where youth leaders will be attached to school-based music clubs in South Africa. These clubs aim to empower young people by providing mentorship, leadership development, and musical engagement, fostering a sense of community and purpose.The exchange aims to strengthen cross-cultural collaboration, equipping youth leaders with practical leadership skills while enhancing local volunteer capacity. By working alongside new club boards, youth leaders will help establish sustainable structures, ensuring long-term impact. The partnership benefits through shared learning, stronger networks, and increased youth engagement, creating a scalable model for future exchanges.</narrative>
  </description>
